[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_desc]
Spy! Isn’t that the most exciting job in the world?\nTo Derpy Hooves, the job of spies is just like what’s in television: wearing a stealth suit, holding a gun (probably a toy gun), sneaking in quietly, and then doing some cool things.\nShe heard that there are spies of the Empire inside Cloudsdale, then, we Cloudsdale should have spies too!\nLet’s build an intelligence agency, and let Duchess Derpy be the first agent!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about spies, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
Disband the intelligence agency.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_desc]
间谍！这不是世界上最刺激的工作吗？\n对于呆蹄来说，间谍的工作就像电视里演的一样：穿着潜行服，拿着枪（可能是玩具枪），悄悄地潜入，然后做一些很酷的事情。\n她听说帝国的间谍潜入了云中城，那么，我们云中城也应该有间谍！\n让我们建立一个情报机构，让呆蹄公爵成为第一个特工！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于间谍的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_21_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
解散情报机构。

